# Treetop Sentries (CR 701.61a): a forage is exiling three cards from your graveyard or sacrificing a Food. Bot1's graveyard holds only two cards (a Lightning
# Bolt and the City Pigeon Bot2's Bolt killed), one short of exiling, so the only way is the Food the Pigeon left behind: Bot1 is asked about that alone,
# accepts, sacrifices the Food (it is gone from the battlefield) and draws a card (the Island it drew on turn 3 makes two). Nothing is exiled.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
City Pigeon
Lightning Bolt
Treetop Sentries
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

